## Stack
- Proxy: Hono + Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL (node-postgres)
- Dashboard: React + Vite + Recharts + Tailwind CSS
- Bot: Discord.js
- DB: PostgreSQL at localhost:5432, db=monit_api, user=monit_api

## Custom Models
- Admins can add custom models per upstream provider via Dashboard > Settings > Upstream Providers > Custom Models
- Custom models appear in `/v1/models` as `{provider}/{modelId}` and are routable through the proxy
- See `docs/features/custom_models.md` for details
